  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "-Trigger sensitivity is inconsistent, making numerous VRChat assets hard to use. (Pens, Video Players, and even the Menu itself.)\n\n-When the Radial Menu is open, certain gestures do not work. (Namely the Fist gesture on the off-hand, and the Rock N' Roll gesture on both hands.)\n\n-Opening the Radial Menu while moving causes the user jolt in the direction they were moving when closing it, regardless of if they stopped moving while it was open.\n\n-The new wrist tracking has caused countless avatars with weapons to become a hassle to use. (Aiming a handgun straight ahead now requires the wrist to be - uncomfortably - twisted roughly 45 degrees outward.)\n\nI know I'm not supposed to report numerous issues at once, but these are very big problems that everyone is experiencing. I hope to see these fixed in the near future.",
